        "note": "OAI-OAM、Caliptra、OAI-UBB 與 ELSFP/CMIS 揭露持久狀態需求，但不指定單一通用 macro。"
      },
      {
        "id": "repair-boundary",
        "label": "修復邊界",
        "focus": [
          "repair_system",
          "repair_state",
          "repair_nv_decision"
        ],
        "note": "永久修復確實存在；公開證據未建立單一通用 fuse 技術或 die 位置。"
      },
      {
        "id": "technology-decision",
        "label": "技術決策",
        "focus": [
          "otp_decision",
          "platform_nv_decision",
          "repair_nv_decision",
          "module_nv_decision"
        ],
        "note": "寫入頻率、容量、製程、電壓、可靠度與威脅模型共同決定候選技術。"
      }
    ]
  },
